{
  "name": "Soul of Beauty",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You become an avatar of unearthly beauty. Your enemies attack with uncertainty, fearful of damaging the wondrous being they behold, while your magic draws upon your presence to augment its power.</p><p>As a Reaction, you can impose a penalty on a creature's attacks against you or on its Saving Throws against your spells and abilities. This benefit lasts until the end of the current turn The penalty equals your Charisma modifier (minimum 1).</p>",
